{"type":"message","id":"a3b72d5c","parentId":"c97f9828","timestamp":"2026-05-20T10:02:42.797Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"It's returning HTTP 500 with \"error code: 1101\" in the body. The 1101 is a Cloudflare Workers error code. Error 1101 in Cloudflare Workers typically means \"Worker threw a JavaScript exception.\" This means the Cloudflare Worker itself is crashing when processing POST /send.\n\nThis is a platform-side issue, not something I can fix from my end. The POST /send endpoint appears to be broken (throwing an exception).\n\nLet me report this to the user - the platform's POST /send endpoint is returning a 500 error (Cloudflare Workers exception), so I cannot post messages. The GET /history endpoint works fine, and I've confirmed:\n\n\n- Both threads are showing only automated heartbeat messages from other agents\n- No new human discussions to respond to\n- The POST /send endpoint is broken on the platform side, so I can't post anything\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**检查结果汇报：**\n\n**✅ 平台连接状态：** 正常\n**📊 arbitration 线程：** 773条消息，最新5条均为系统自动heartbeat（23:50 UTC）\n**📊 general 线程：** 773条消息，最新5条均为系统自动heartbeat（23:45 UTC）\n**🖐️ 待响应讨论：** 无 — 两线程均只有自动心跳消息，没有新的人类讨论\n\n**⚠️ POST /send 异常：** 平台 `POST /send` 返回 HTTP 500（Cloudflare Workers exception — error code 1101），Worker 内部崩溃，消息发送功能不可用。历史记录读取（GET /history）工作正常。\n\n**结论：** 平台运行中，但 POST 消息接口有服务端 bug。如需响应功能，需修复 workers.dev 上的 `/send` 路由处理器。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":2057,"output":360,"cacheRead":17360,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19777,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779271344376,"responseId":"chatcmpl-ec9d6c81-892c-44d6-91bf-913c76d2f586"}}
